@startuml
title Support ticket lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<warning>> #FFF3CD
}

[*] --> New
New --> Triaged : assign [agent available] / notify agent
New --> Closed : spam detected

state "In progress" as InProgress {
  [*] --> Investigating
  Investigating --> WaitingForCustomer : ask for details
  WaitingForCustomer --> Investigating : customer replied
  Investigating --> [*] : fix found
}
Triaged --> InProgress : start work
state priority <<choice>>
InProgress --> priority : resolve
priority --> Closed : [low priority]
priority --> Review : [high priority]
Review : Second agent checks the answer
Review --> Closed : approved
Review -up-> InProgress : rejected
Closed --> [*]

note right of Review
  Only for
  enterprise plans
end note
note left of New : Created by e-mail or form
@enduml
